  "details": "The gallery menu on Quest only displays the first 16 images you take. Any images taken after that are inaccessible on Quest unless you delete one of the previous 16 images.\n\nThe counter also never goes above 16/64. Expanding the menu doesn't update the list.\n\nFor a Quest user with no other means of taking photos, it’s kind of a slap to the face after paying $10 a month for the feature you purchased it for not work as promised.\n\nhttps://youtu.be/iXvqhpv_yJQ",
